WEBVTT

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.170
You okay, Kluke?

00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:03.226
Yeah. I'm sure Zola will be here soon.
Until then...

00:02:09.933 --> 00:02:11.673
I don't know about that.

00:02:17.266 --> 00:02:18.896
Feather Protect!

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:49.800
SNEAKY SNEAKY SHOCK!

00:03:00.633 --> 00:03:01.633
Maro!

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:03.930
Rock Weapon!

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:05.603
Maro!

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.700
This power...
I feel like I can't lose.

00:03:14.066 --> 00:03:16.096
Is this the result of
General Logi's research?

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:21.100
But if we use it too much,
we'll end up like Gilliam and Cynthia.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:26.030
That's what power essentially is.
We'll take them out one at a time.

00:03:26.466 --> 00:03:27.626
Let's work efficiently.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.170
First, we'll start with that yellow one.

00:03:36.466 --> 00:03:38.696
You're totally missing us, maro!

00:03:39.733 --> 00:03:41.273
Take a good look around you.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:42.600
Maro?

00:03:43.766 --> 00:03:44.766
What's this?!

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:48.900
It's over.

00:03:51.033 --> 00:03:52.673
Round and round, maro!

00:03:57.633 --> 00:03:59.833
H-How about that, maro?

00:03:59.866 --> 00:04:01.296
Rock Weapon.

00:04:03.366 --> 00:04:04.826
Maro.

00:04:05.033 --> 00:04:06.033
Marumaro!

00:04:07.333 --> 00:04:09.773
Maro...

00:04:10.033 --> 00:04:10.703
Next!

00:04:10.866 --> 00:04:11.866
Roger!

00:04:21.166 --> 00:04:22.166
She's here...

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.670
Even Lemaire, too?

00:04:25.033 --> 00:04:26.303
Is Marumaro okay?

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:29.403
- Maro...
- Sorry.

00:04:29.433 --> 00:04:30.473
We weren't able to break through...

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:35.430
No, you did well
stalling them here, Jiro.

00:04:36.666 --> 00:04:37.326
What is it?

00:04:37.966 --> 00:04:40.796
It's been a while
since we fought together.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.400
That's right.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:43.770
Let's go!

00:04:44.133 --> 00:04:45.133
Yeah!

00:04:55.633 --> 00:04:58.733
Not bad. Looks like I'll be
able to have some fun.

00:04:59.533 --> 00:05:01.233
To think we'd get pushed back...

00:05:01.833 --> 00:05:05.773
These two are experienced in battle.
We can't beat them one by one.

00:05:06.133 --> 00:05:09.173
There's no need for us to dig
our own graves by wasting too much power.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.100
It'll be fine even if we don't beat them
as long as we can stall them.

00:05:12.433 --> 00:05:14.773
I suppose we'll wait for
General Logi's instructions then.

00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:26.333
It's the information Homeron
risked his life to get for us.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.970
I won't let it go to waste!

00:05:30.566 --> 00:05:32.026
Time to turn invisible!

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.830
Okay, I'm going to vanish.

00:05:45.133 --> 00:05:46.173
Vanish, vanish!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.870
Let's see...
This is the right way, right?

00:06:06.066 --> 00:06:07.526
Stop it!

00:06:11.533 --> 00:06:12.533
Damn it!

00:06:13.666 --> 00:06:14.326
Shu!

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:18.700
I've figured it out!
Logi's attack has a certain pattern!

00:06:18.966 --> 00:06:22.026
I'll seize the opportunity
and plunge forward.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.630
But if you do something like that,
you'll be...

00:06:24.733 --> 00:06:26.033
I'm already at my limits!

00:06:26.066 --> 00:06:26.726
What?

00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:30.303
At this rate, we'll be destroyed!
I'll gamble on that brief moment!

00:06:30.733 --> 00:06:34.303
Phoenix and I will stop
Logi's attack for a moment!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.470
You seize the opportunity and
defeat him with Blue Dragon!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:38.500
Got it!

00:06:38.566 --> 00:06:41.366
I'm counting on you.
I can only hold a second...

00:06:41.866 --> 00:06:47.026
I'll do it! It's totally not cool just
being protected by you, anyway!

00:06:48.933 --> 00:06:49.933
Now!

00:06:51.033 --> 00:06:52.873
Dance in the Dark!

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:01.970
You're mine!

00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:40.973
A draw...or that's what I'd like to say...

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:46.330
But it appears I was just slightly
faster than she calculated.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.830
The coordination between
defensive Phoenix

00:07:51.866 --> 00:07:54.066
and offensive Blue Dragon
was nearly perfect.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.700
You've grown so much in
such a short period of time.

00:07:58.933 --> 00:08:01.873
However, you lack actual
battle experience compared to me,

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.270
and that decided the outcome.

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:04.700
Do you understand, boy?

00:08:04.966 --> 00:08:09.826
You guys might've won if
she'd really wanted to kill me.

00:08:10.966 --> 00:08:17.366
However, the action she took in that
life-or-death moment was to protect you.

00:08:17.866 --> 00:08:18.866
That was it.

00:08:22.166 --> 00:08:22.826
Kluke...

00:08:24.733 --> 00:08:25.403
Kluke...

00:08:26.566 --> 00:08:27.566
Kluke is...

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.000
Kluke is!

00:08:31.533 --> 00:08:35.533
It's time to bid an end to
the legend you speak of.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:41.600
Descendants of the Soldiers of Light
are just like fossils anyway...

00:08:42.966 --> 00:08:46.596
It's your destiny to fade away
at the hands of

00:08:46.633 --> 00:08:48.703
our Shadows born in this new era.

00:08:49.533 --> 00:08:54.703
We will be using the Extra Seven
for the new world we will create.

00:08:55.566 --> 00:08:58.596
That is the destiny of the ones
who have the power.

00:08:58.766 --> 00:09:01.666
It's a mission.
Do you understand, boy?

00:09:02.166 --> 00:09:03.866
The excessive power you possess

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:06.600
will once again become legend
and vanish from this world.

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:48.500
The energy levels are on the rise...

00:09:49.066 --> 00:09:51.966
I've never seen numbers
like this before!

00:09:55.233 --> 00:09:57.503
Rose in May!

00:10:03.033 --> 00:10:03.703
What?!

00:10:04.233 --> 00:10:07.833
I wasn't just watching Kluke
holding out against your attack.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:15.130
I couldn't see it at first, but now I can.
I've gotten the feel for your technique, Logi!

00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:19.773
Indeed, it's no longer a move that
can be called a secret technique...

00:10:20.233 --> 00:10:24.373
However, it was a bad move
to smash Valkyrie's shield.

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:25.470
What?

00:10:30.266 --> 00:10:35.896
I wonder if you can dodge Rose in May
released from two swords simultaneously.

00:10:36.766 --> 00:10:40.896
I'm not afraid of you anymore, Logi!
You can babble all you want!

00:10:43.066 --> 00:10:44.166
Good, Shu.

00:10:44.866 --> 00:10:46.826
I'm starting to get good vibes.

00:10:47.666 --> 00:10:52.696
Buzz off, Blue Dragon,
along with the sickening legend!

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:17.600
You say you're descendents
of the Soldiers of Light,

00:11:17.633 --> 00:11:21.373
yet you still haven't grasped
the true power of the Shadow.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:23.800
That doesn't make any difference!

00:11:23.833 --> 00:11:28.173
Then let me ask you something.
Why do you use the power of the Shadow?

00:11:28.433 --> 00:11:30.203
Isn't that obvious?!

00:11:30.466 --> 00:11:32.666
It's to protect the people
I want to protect!

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:33.970
So?

00:11:34.566 --> 00:11:37.396
Were you able to protect those people
you wanted to protect?

00:11:39.366 --> 00:11:40.396
It's because...

00:11:42.133 --> 00:11:43.173
You guys...

00:11:44.433 --> 00:11:45.703
You guys did...

00:11:48.033 --> 00:11:50.673
In other words,
with the power of the Shadow,

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:53.630
you were unable to protect those
you were supposed to protect.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:58.770
The power you possess
was meaningless.

00:12:10.566 --> 00:12:11.696
Shut up!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:17.400
The Shadows are not used to protect.

00:12:19.766 --> 00:12:21.966
I couldn't care less about logic like that!

00:12:23.066 --> 00:12:26.096
You jerks have taken
the lives of many people!

00:12:26.766 --> 00:12:28.496
I won't tolerate people like that!

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:34.530
You can't wrap your head around it, huh?
Then feel the power of the Shadow...

00:12:35.166 --> 00:12:37.026
Feel the true meaning of it!

00:12:37.233 --> 00:12:40.673
Logi! I'll defeat you no matter what!

00:12:40.933 --> 00:12:44.033
The energy levels are increasing!
This is dangerous!

00:12:44.566 --> 00:12:47.496
There is an unidentified energy
gathering in this space...

00:12:47.966 --> 00:12:50.696
No, gathering around General Logi!

00:12:51.133 --> 00:12:54.903
No! It's that boy!
We must evacuate General Logi.

00:13:00.333 --> 00:13:03.073
Is it reacting with the Extra Seven?

00:13:03.566 --> 00:13:06.096
Is this the legendary power?!

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.370
The Extra Seven?

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:10.870
I bet these are it!

00:13:11.133 --> 00:13:14.333
A seven-page document
written in ancient letters...

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.500
These are the Extra Seven...

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.700
The Extra Seven...

00:13:22.933 --> 00:13:24.503
It's the wrath of God!

00:13:27.566 --> 00:13:29.026
W-What's going on?!

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:31.630
But lucky me.
There's nobody here.

00:13:31.866 --> 00:13:32.896
Now's my chance!

00:13:38.033 --> 00:13:41.433
I got the Extra Seven!
All right!

00:13:41.466 --> 00:13:42.126
Oh?

00:13:42.366 --> 00:13:45.126
Yes, you're holding the Extra Seven.

00:13:46.433 --> 00:13:48.373
The power to turn invisible...

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.500
You're from the Ra Clan, right?

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:56.270
So it was all an operation to
make you infiltrate the ship, huh?

00:13:56.933 --> 00:14:03.603
I know! You're Delphinium, aren't you?!
You're the one Shu said killed Homeron!

00:14:04.266 --> 00:14:06.626
Homeron was destined to die.

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:11.530
Information serves its purpose only when
given to those who can make good use of it.

00:14:12.033 --> 00:14:16.533
Only someone like General Logi
deserves to possess the Extra Seven.

00:14:17.366 --> 00:14:20.926
We're descendants of
the Soldiers of Light, you know!

00:14:22.133 --> 00:14:25.673
That's right. Very well.
Take it with you.

00:14:26.366 --> 00:14:31.096
If you can get past me, that is!

00:14:38.733 --> 00:14:39.973
I let her get away!

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.470
But she won't be able to get off this ship!

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:49.730
There is an enemy Shadow Wielder
at large onboard the ship.

00:14:50.233 --> 00:14:51.773
All crew members
to security positions.

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:55.000
General Logi, we have
a checkmate on our end.

00:14:55.733 --> 00:14:56.733
Got it.

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:05.930
Damn it. I'll nail him with the next one!

00:15:42.533 --> 00:15:44.203
I'm finished here, too.

00:15:44.866 --> 00:15:47.366
Roger. It is our victory!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.200
I'm returning to the ship.

00:15:52.233 --> 00:15:54.103
Good job, Valkyrie.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:55.270
Yes, sir.

00:16:40.633 --> 00:16:42.233
Brat!

00:16:58.733 --> 00:17:02.103
W-What is this?!

00:17:14.633 --> 00:17:15.303
What?!

00:17:16.033 --> 00:17:17.533
It's over where General Logi is.

00:17:18.966 --> 00:17:20.596
N-No way.

00:17:59.433 --> 00:18:02.433
Is he going out of control?
But he looks...

00:18:03.133 --> 00:18:06.773
His Shadow is about to
swallow Shu up.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:10.470
Is that Blue Dragon? Or...

00:18:15.633 --> 00:18:18.273
Light and Shadow
are becoming one...

00:18:18.466 --> 00:18:20.866
This is the ultimate power.

00:18:21.266 --> 00:18:25.066
Is this the true form of the legendary
Shadow Wielder's power?

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:29.270
Impossible! Andropov, Schneider!
Can you hear me?

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:32.100
Evacuate with General Logi immediately!

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.200
Blue Dragon...

00:18:53.933 --> 00:18:54.933
Shu!

00:18:58.900 --> 00:18:59.900
General Logi!

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:08.270
There she is!

00:19:08.533 --> 00:19:09.203
Freeze!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.000
No! Get out of my way!

00:19:13.466 --> 00:19:16.226
This is Andropov.
I've returned with General Logi.

00:19:16.866 --> 00:19:19.196
Roger! Lift off immediately!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:27.670
Shu!

00:19:28.466 --> 00:19:29.626
Don't do it, Shu!

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:33.800
Kluke...

00:19:34.633 --> 00:19:39.773
Destroy everything.
Release your Shadow.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.800
That is true power...

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:43.600
Shu!

00:19:58.233 --> 00:20:00.203
Oh, let's escape through there, Hippo!

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:03.570
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform.

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.030
Turn into a bird!

00:20:10.333 --> 00:20:11.433
You won't get away!

00:20:20.733 --> 00:20:22.003
Good work.

00:20:35.833 --> 00:20:36.833
Shu!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:40.800
Kluke...

00:20:42.733 --> 00:20:44.973
Thank goodness you're okay...

00:20:45.466 --> 00:20:46.626
What happened?

00:20:48.766 --> 00:20:49.766
I don't know.

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:55.570
After you got hit, I got angry, and...
I don't know...

00:20:56.966 --> 00:20:58.796
You were almost swallowed up
by your Shadow.

00:21:01.066 --> 00:21:01.726
By my Shadow?

00:21:15.566 --> 00:21:18.566
I have secured the Extra Seven.

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:21.170
Good work.

00:21:25.833 --> 00:21:29.103
So that's the legendary
Shadow Wielder's power?

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:34.970
But that power is
meaningless before him.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.070
I was so close.

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:40.770
I see...

00:21:41.033 --> 00:21:42.303
We're right back where
we started again.

00:21:42.666 --> 00:21:47.096
You may say that,
but we almost got killed.

00:21:47.433 --> 00:21:51.373
And the ship has taken off, so we can't
go steal the Extra Seven anymore!

00:21:52.033 --> 00:21:54.633
What was the Extra Seven like, maro?

00:21:54.666 --> 00:21:56.066
You saw it, didn't you?

00:21:56.366 --> 00:21:57.026
Yeah...

00:21:57.833 --> 00:21:58.833
So you saw it.

00:21:58.866 --> 00:22:00.626
I wanted to see it, too.

00:22:01.333 --> 00:22:02.003
Sure.

00:22:03.333 --> 00:22:06.103
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform.

00:22:07.366 --> 00:22:08.626
- Oh.
- Maro.

00:22:08.666 --> 00:22:10.296
So this is the Extra Seven?

00:22:10.666 --> 00:22:15.426
Aye, we can transform into
anything we've seen once.

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:17.100
- Wow!
- Wow!

00:22:17.866 --> 00:22:21.126
I'm really sorry.
All of you did your best, yet...

00:22:27.100 --> 00:22:27.770
Maro...

00:22:29.066 --> 00:22:30.526
Huh? This means...

00:22:31.733 --> 00:22:35.333
I'm sorry!
I'll show you again as an apology.

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:38.170
- It's a success!
- It's a success!

00:22:43.966 --> 00:22:45.496
Huh? What?

00:24:16.433 --> 00:24:17.833
Shu and the others
start deciphering

00:24:17.866 --> 00:24:19.866
the Extra Seven that Bouquet
has transformed into.

00:24:19.900 --> 00:24:22.600
They face many difficulties
in the course of doing that.

00:24:22.633 --> 00:24:24.903
I have no idea what's written here.

00:24:24.933 --> 00:24:29.703
Don't stare at me like that.
Boys sure are naughty.

00:24:29.733 --> 00:24:32.373
Hey, I'm copying right now,
so don't move.

00:24:32.400 --> 00:24:34.970
Next on Blue Dragon:
The Extra Seven
